614	     * of any existing owner. The key ({@code normalizedTelephone + '|' + (email or empty) + '|' +
615	     * (householdId or empty)}) is the single consolidated duplicate-detection key that replaces the
616	     * former separate telephone, email and household checks. Because the telephone is part of the
617	     * key, two members of the same household (same {@code householdId}) with different telephones
618	     * have different keys and are both allowed; only an exact full-key match is a duplicate. The key
619	     * is derived identically for the incoming and existing owners via {@link OwnerMapper#toIdentityKey}.
